      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "MakeFrameLayout\nTupleMap\nLocation::  MemPointer\n工具类（公共方法），Std::Int完善\n标准库，面向Tensor编程\n\n减少scalar，一切皆为类型\n拓展到Vector层面\n\n\n归一化的接口\n提高cube,vector利用率",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "MakeFrameLayout\nTupleMap\nLocation::  MemPointer\n工具类（公共方法），Std::Int完善\n标准库，面向Tensor编程\n\n减少scalar，一切皆为类型\n拓展到Vector层面\n\n\n归一化的接口\n提高cube,vector利用率",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    }
